title: APC NetBotz: Smoke sensors
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors smoke sensors of APC NetBotz appliances via SNMP
 (NetBotz50-MIB, smokeSensorTable).

 The service is {OK} if no smoke is detected, {CRIT} if smoke is detected
 and {UNKNOWN} if the value is undefined. An error status of the sensor
 adds {WARN} (warning) or {CRIT} (error, critical, failure).

item:
 The sensor id as reported by the device.

discovery:
 One service is created for each smoke sensor.
